# Asclepius Wellness Private Limited (AWPL)
> A leading direct selling company in India offering wellness, healthcare, herbal, cosmetic, agriculture, food, and lifestyle products since 2013.

Asclepius Wellness Private Limited (commonly known as AWPL) is an Indian direct selling company that manufactures and distributes high-quality products across 15+ categories including wellness supplements, herbal products, cosmetics, spices, baby care, home care, oral care, agriculture, fragrances, apparels, and veterinary products. The company provides business opportunities to direct sellers across India with no joining fees.

